[290.447074, "o", "\r\ntest:      EventList (the event catalog) sorting asks again in the chosen order\r\nfile:      test/javascript/EventsApp/EventCatalog/EventList.test.tsx\r\nobserved:  flaky, 15 fails in 36 runs (fail rate 27%..58%)\r\n\r\nWAIT-TIMEOUT  (high confidence)\r\n  evidence:\r\n    - failing runs take about 1219 ms, passing runs about 184 ms (7x)\r\n    - two clusters, fast or timed out: the awaited update sometimes never arrives\r\n  fix: A wait is timing out. Raising the timeout will not fix it, because in the failing runs the update never arrives. Find why it sometimes does not happen: a missing await, an event fired before its listener exists, or state set outside act().\r\n  reproduce: for i in $(seq 30); do npx vitest run test/javascript/EventsApp/EventCatalog/EventList.test.tsx || break; done\r\n\r\n"]
[290.461279, "o", "exit code: 1\r\n"]
